# Cortex -- environment configuration template.
# Copy to .env and fill in real values if you introduce any; never commit
# the real .env file (already excluded in .gitignore).
#
# Current state, honestly: this prototype has NO required secrets, API
# keys, or credentials. The two demo accounts used in the live walkthrough
# (see README.md) are hardcoded, non-sensitive placeholder credentials in
# src/serving/app.py -- not real accounts, not a real auth system.
#
# The one path below is currently hardcoded in src/graph_pipeline/config.py
# (DATA_DIR) rather than read from the environment. Listed here as the
# clear candidate for env-based config in a real deployment, not because
# it's required today.

# DATA_DIR=C:\path\to\the\folder\containing\the\raw\hackathon\CSV\files
